        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI 401-305, 12 Inch Stainless Steel Rectangular Offset Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 12 Inch Satin Stainless Steel Offset Pulls feature an easy to grip rectangular pull handle that is very comfortable. Optional mounting kits for use on wood, fiberglass, metal, or glass doors. For use on residential and commercial doors such as storefront doors. The Satin Stainless Steel finish requiring little maintenance, designed to enhance any setting where a clean modern look is desired.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 12 Inch Modern Rectangular Offset Pull Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 11-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1\" x 1/2\" Rectangular</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-1/4\" to 3\" thick.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-401-305-specifications.pdf?v=1691093354\"><b>AHI 401-305 12\" Rectangular Offset Pull Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
